        "section_id": "nav:jamieson-fausset-brown:PRO.9:P:pr-9-1-18-the-commendation-of-wisdom-is-continued-under-the-figure-of-a-libera",
        "navigation_id": "PRO.9:P:pr-9-1-18-the-commendation-of-wisdom-is-continued-under-the-figure-of-a-libera",
        "scope": "passage",
        "role": "passage_overview",
        "title": "Pr 9:1-18 . The commendation of wisdom is continued, under the figure of a liberal host, and its provisions under that of a feast (compare Lu 14:16-24 ). The character of those who are invited is followed by a contrasted description of the rejectors of good counsel; and with the invitations of wisdom are contrasted the allurement of the wicked woman."
      }
